# macf-bootstrap — secrets-on-disk hygiene (DR-035 §4, science's #659 review).
# Belt-and-suspenders against a stray `git add` / commit in this no-prompt git
# workspace. The real at-rest protection is FileVault; this just keeps the scratch
# secrets out of version control. Never relax these without an explicit reason.
/.bootstrap-work/
*.app.json
vault.plain
vault*.age
vault-age-key.txt
